msgid "Linux 系统名兼容启动命令"
msgstr "Linux system-name compatibility launcher"

msgid "``linuxuname 程序 [参数…]`` 启动指定程序，让该程序调用 ``uname(2)`` 时 得到 ``Linux`` 系统名。例如::"
msgstr "``linuxuname PROGRAM [ARGUMENT...]`` launches a program whose ``uname(2)`` calls report the system name ``Linux``. For example::"

msgid "命令按 ``PATH`` 查找程序，也接受绝对路径、相对路径及脚本。 程序参数、环境变量和工作目录原样保留；命令用 ``execvp`` 替换自身， 程序的退出码和信号直接传递给调用者。``--`` 可用于结束命令本身的解析::"
msgstr "The command searches ``PATH`` and also accepts absolute paths, relative paths, and scripts. Arguments, environment variables, and the working directory are preserved. It replaces itself with ``execvp``, so the program's exit status and signals pass directly to the caller. Use ``--`` to end parsing of launcher arguments::"

msgid "作用范围"
msgstr "Scope"

msgid "该选择由内核为调用任务保存，经过 ``fork``、``vfork``、``clone`` 和 ``exec`` 继承，因此目标程序创建的线程及子进程也会看到 ``Linux``。 启动它的终端和其他已存在的进程仍看到 ``ReliefNT``。 动态链接、静态链接和直接发起 ``uname`` 系统调用的程序均适用。"
msgstr "The kernel stores this selection for the calling task and inherits it through ``fork``, ``vfork``, ``clone``, and ``exec``. Threads and child processes created by the target also see ``Linux``. Its parent terminal and other existing processes still see ``ReliefNT``. Dynamically linked, statically linked, and direct-syscall programs are supported."

msgid "仅 ``utsname.sysname`` 改变；内核版本、构建信息、架构、主机名和域名 保持原值。``/proc`` 中的全局内核信息不变。此命令可通过仅检查系统名的 兼容性判断，缺失的系统调用、驱动或其他 Linux 功能仍需实际实现。 普通用户可使用，不要求 root 权限。"
msgstr "Only ``utsname.sysname`` changes. Kernel version, build information, architecture, hostname, and domain name retain their values. Global kernel information in ``/proc`` is unchanged. This command can satisfy compatibility checks that examine only the system name; missing system calls, drivers, and other Linux features still require implementation. Ordinary users can run it without root privileges."

msgid "错误处理"
msgstr "Error handling"

msgid "``linuxuname --help`` 显示用法。没有指定程序或内核不支持该选择时返回 125；程序无法执行时返回 126；程序不存在时返回 127。"
msgstr "``linuxuname --help`` prints usage. The command returns 125 when no program is specified or the kernel does not support the selection, 126 when the program cannot execute, and 127 when it does not exist."

msgid "组件默认构建并随系统镜像安装，在 Menuconfig 的 System applications 中可关闭 Linux uname launcher；安装后的命令入口为 ``/usr/bin/linuxuname``。"
msgstr "The component is built and included in system images by default. Disable Linux uname launcher under System applications in Menuconfig to omit it. The installed command is ``/usr/bin/linuxuname``."
